OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers in
OL,6,Fthe south soon dying out, otherwise a
OL,7,Fdry evening with sunny spells. Skies
OL,8,Fbecoming mostly clear overnight and
OL,9,Fturning chilly, especially in the
OL,10,Fglens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA chilly start then a mainly
OL,13,Fdry and bright day with the best of
OL,14,Fthe sunny spells in the south.
OL,15,FCloudier across Argyll with a few
OL,16,Flight showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
